DESCRIPTION:Jibboom is not a club—it's a welcoming gathering for anyone 
 who enjoys Connecticut's rich maritime heritage. Join us on the third Tues
 day of each month\, now through December\, at 1:30 p.m. for an engaging pr
 esentation by a maritime speaker\, followed by light refreshments and frie
 ndly conversation. Bring a friend and discover something new. Admission is
  free\, thanks to the generous sponsorship of Rose & Joe Maco.\n\nSource: 
 https://ctvisit.com/events/jibboom-club-1
LOCATION:Custom House Maritime Museum\, Custom House Maritime Museum\, 150
  Bank Street\, New London CT\, 06320
